          "id": "1768584128050",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1768584128052_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Data: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.OraAction}}\n\nReview the Q&A and provide an objective summary of the candidate's strengths, concerns, reliability, and overall suitability based only on the provided responses.\nIf the payload has borderline or mixed feedback, clearly explain the details that need review.\nInclude exactly one follow-up action for the same candidate after the details summary:\n- action button text: Move Forward\n- agent command: MoveForward\n- command format: ora.Invoke(\"MoveForward\",{\"action\":\"Move_To_Offer\",\"submissionId\":\"<submissionId>\",\"requisitionId\":\"<requisitionId>\",\"candidateName\":\"<candidateName>\"})\nUse the submissionId, requisitionId, and candidateName from the input payload exactly as provided. Do not invent IDs or candidate names.\nOutput only the details response and the Move Forward action, without raw JSON or invented data."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "ACTIONS_AGENT",
            "workflowCode": "ORA_HCM_IRC_READY_FOR_OFFER_ACTION"
          },
