              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "## WIDGET 1: \nGenerate multiRecordWidget with:\nUsing this data, provide the feedback statistics:\nCompleted: {{$context.$variables.feedbacks.completed.length}}\nIn Progress: {{$context.$variables.feedbacks.saved.length}}\nPending: {{$context.$variables.feedbacks.requested.length}}\nTitle this section: 'Get input from all interviewers'\nSummarize if there which interviewers have pending requests and suggest following up with them to get feedback completed.\n\n\n## WIDGET 2: \nGenerate multiRecordWidget for Data {{$context.$nodes.COUNTPARTICIPANT.$output.result}} \n\nGenerate a table where each row represents a participant, and the columns are:\n* Participant Name\n* Pending\n* In Progress\n* Completed\n\n\n## Notes\n* Do not ask any clarifying questions, answer the best you can.\n* Do not display sample or dummy data if data is not avialable\n* Do not reference the prompt, prior context, or “above data” in your response. Answer directly.\n* Do not show multiple records for the same participant name; combine duplicate participant rows into one row."
