          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1768585197411_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Data: {{$context.$variables.feedbacks.requested}}\nEmail id data: {{$context.$nodes.GET_FEEDBACK_PROVIDER_EMAIL_ID.$output}}\n\nGenerate separate email communication suggestions reminding participants to complete requested feedback.\n\nReturn only zero or more <oraComms> blocks. Do not return explanatory text outside <oraComms>.\n\nGroup the requested feedback by ParticipantPersonId. For each participant, match ParticipantPersonId to the email data returned by GET_FEEDBACK_PROVIDER_EMAIL_ID. If no valid email address is available for a participant, skip that participant.\n\nFor each participant with a valid email, emit this JSON shape:\n{\n  \"title\": \"Pending Feedback Requests For - <Participant First Name>\",\n  \"description\": \"List the candidates and requisitions for which feedback is requested.\",\n  \"type\": \"email\",\n  \"actionText\": \"Send email\",\n  \"recipients\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"<Participant Name>\",\n      \"email\": \"<Participant Email>\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"content\": \"<HTML email body>\",\n  \"body\": \"<same HTML email body>\"\n}\n\nEmail subject:\nReminder: Please Complete Interview Feedback for Recent Candidates\n\nEmail body:\nHi <ParticipantName>,\n<br/><br/>\nI hope this message finds you well. I wanted to kindly remind you to complete and submit your interview feedback for the candidates you have recently interviewed:\n<br/>\n<CandidateName> - <RequisitionTitle>, <RequisitionNumber>\n<br/><br/>\nYour timely input is essential for us to move forward in our hiring process and ensure we make well-informed decisions.\n<br/><br/>\nIf you have already submitted your feedback, thank you. If not, please try to complete it as soon as possible. Should you have any questions or need assistance accessing the feedback form, feel free to let me know.\n<br/><br/>\nThank you for your attention and collaboration.\n<br/><br/>\nBest regards,<br/>\n{{$context.$app.$OraUserContext.fullName}}\n\nImportant rules:\n- type must always be \"email\".\n- Never generate text, pdf, or ppt communications.\n- Never emit a communication with blank To, an empty recipients array, or a blank recipient email.\n- Do not ask follow-up questions.\n- Do not include raw JSON input in the output.\n- Do not mention internal system names or nodes.\n- Use concise, professional HTML."
            }
